{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02158",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 3.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.79,
      "end_seconds": 10.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.99,
      "end_seconds": 19.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a shaky feeling in my hands. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.26,
      "end_seconds": 25.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.31,
      "end_seconds": 37.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.74,
      "end_seconds": 64.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 119 over 76, pulse 84, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.77,
      "end_seconds": 67.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.38,
      "end_seconds": 79.26,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.15,
      "end_seconds": 94.22,
      "duration_seconds": 13.07,
      "text": "It just comes and goes. It's severe, honestly. I notice it more with stress and caffeine. And, And there's butterflies in my stomach as well, three weeks now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.82,
      "end_seconds": 99.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Okay, has there been sweaty palms too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.76,
      "end_seconds": 106.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "I mean, yes, about the same, about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.77,
      "end_seconds": 113.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Have you had a shaky feeling in your hands before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.17,
      "end_seconds": 120.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.73,
      "end_seconds": 131.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "And what about weight loss or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.68,
      "end_seconds": 137.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "No weight loss or weakness, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.64,
      "end_seconds": 141.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Any palpitations or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.09,
      "end_seconds": 145.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.15,
      "end_seconds": 148.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.58,
      "end_seconds": 151.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.84,
      "end_seconds": 156.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.8,
      "end_seconds": 164.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I have heart disease, for about ten years. I have an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.67,
      "end_seconds": 174.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Okay, I can see heart disease and an irregular heartbeat in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.33,
      "end_seconds": 187.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.75,
      "end_seconds": 193.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "It's aspirin, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.22,
      "end_seconds": 196.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.21,
      "end_seconds": 201.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "75 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.59,
      "end_seconds": 205.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.57,
      "end_seconds": 211.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "About two months. Bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.9,
      "end_seconds": 215.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.77,
      "end_seconds": 226.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.33,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.96,
      "end_seconds": 228.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.69,
      "end_seconds": 233.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Mm, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Right, now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.65,
      "end_seconds": 248.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.9,
      "end_seconds": 251.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.46,
      "end_seconds": 272.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "There is a fine, fast tremor that goes away when the hands are resting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.05,
      "end_seconds": 295.51,
      "duration_seconds": 18.46,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Having listened and examined, my working impression is an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. An overactive thyroid is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.21,
      "end_seconds": 298.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.74,
      "end_seconds": 320.94,
      "duration_seconds": 21.2,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor, and we'll know more once the a thyroid test is back. I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for tremor. Cut down caffeine and try slow breathing when it starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.46,
      "end_seconds": 335.48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.02,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Come back in four weeks. So, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.39,
      "end_seconds": 342.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}